<%- /*
The trigger, the draft step and every later step's condition are the hosted gate shape
(templates/hostedgate.go, defined in internal/ghworkflow/hostedgate.go): the job runs on a push to
the default branch and on every pull request activity that can change what merges, and on a draft
it fails in its first step, saying it runs when the pull request is marked ready (#817). Every
rendering this body or an earlier one produced is recorded (internal/flavor/ci_prior.go), so an
unedited copy is refreshed without --force.
*/ -%>
---
name: CI

<% hostedGateOn %>
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-26.04
    steps:
<% hostedGateDraftStep %>
      - name: Checkout source<% hostedGateStepIf %>
        uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - name: Setup Flutter<% hostedGateStepIf %>
        uses: subosito/flutter-action@v2
        with:
          channel: stable

      - name: Install dependencies<% hostedGateStepIf %>
        run: flutter pub get

      - name: Analyze<% hostedGateStepIf %>
        run: flutter analyze

      - name: Test<% hostedGateStepIf %>
        run: flutter test
